{"program":"class Solution:\n    def twoSum(self, nums: List[int], target: int) -> List[int]:\n        seen = {}\n        for i, n in enumerate(nums):\n            need = target - n\n            if need in seen:\n                return [seen[need], i]\n            seen[n] = i\n        return []\n\n# CodeLens runs your solution on this input:\nnums = [3, 8, 5, 1]\ntarget = 6\nresult = Solution().twoSum(nums, target)\nprint(result)\n","trace":{"status":"ok","truncated":false,"codeHash":"a045f75a101115fa7cfa7242e0643a29e9d842b2133e5e3555ba78ed83c2be46","steps":[{"index":0,"line":1,"event":"call","functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","depth":0,"locals":{},"stdout":"","heap":{},"stack":[{"functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","line":1,"locals":{}}]},{"index":1,"line":1,"event":"line","functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","depth":0,"locals":{},"stdout":"","heap":{},"stack":[{"functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","line":1,"locals":{}}]},{"index":2,"line":1,"event":"call","functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","depth":1,"locals":{},"stdout":"","heap":{},"stack":[{"functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","line":1,"locals":{}},{"functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","line":1,"locals":{}}]},{"index":3,"line":1,"event":"line","functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","depth":1,"locals":{},"stdout":"","heap":{},"stack":[{"functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","line":1,"locals":{}},{"functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","line":1,"locals":{}}]},{"index":4,"line":2,"event":"line","functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","depth":1,"locals":{},"stdout":"","heap":{},"stack":[{"functionName":"<module>","frameId":"module","line":1,"locals":{}},{"functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","line":2,"locals":{}}]},{"index":5,"line":2,"event":"return","functionName":"Solution","frameId":"Solution-1","depth":1,"locals":{"twoSum":{"__type__":"function"}},"stdout":"","returnValue":null,"heap":{},"stack":[{"